   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Aerial shot of Eagle Pass, Texas on a clear sunny day in spring. Eagle Pass is the oldest settlement on the Rio Grande River along the United States border with Mexico.</rdf:li>
